WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.298 --> 00:00:05.457
Tap a rod in the palette to put it on the board.

2
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:12.105
Drag a rod to move it. Hold it for its actions.

3
00:00:12.105 --> 00:00:15.123
Today’s task: two-rod trains as long as the black rod.

4
00:00:15.123 --> 00:00:17.653
Drag a rod under another one. It snaps into place.

5
00:00:17.653 --> 00:00:20.137
Drag red to the end of yellow: 5 + 2 makes 7.

6
00:00:20.137 --> 00:00:27.274
A second train: dark green and white, 6 + 1.

7
00:00:27.274 --> 00:00:30.810
Drag across empty board to select many pieces at once.

8
00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.328
Drag one of them and they all move together.

9
00:00:33.328 --> 00:00:37.783
Give the white rod a value. The total follows.

10
00:00:37.783 --> 00:00:46.542
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
